    <defName>RM_CanopySwinger</defName>
    <label>canopy swinger</label>
    <description>A lean, long-limbed climber that never touches the ground if it can help it, crossing the gaps between the Greentide's giants hand over hand along vine and branch. When the canopy runs out, or something faster is behind it, it simply lets go, trusting the river below to break the fall better than whatever is chasing it.</description>
